mit\">Submit Bot</a></div><button class=\"xl:hidden flex items-center justify-center h-8 w-8 sm:h-9 sm:w-9 text-[#8A8F87] hover:text-[#8FBF3F] transition-colors shrink-0\" aria-label=\"Toggle menu\"><svg class=\"h-5 w-5 sm:h-6 sm:w-6\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></header><main class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col pt-16\"><div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-20 font-mono text-xs text-[#8FBF3F]\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 border border-[#212623] bg-[#131615]/80 px-4 py-3 rounded-lg shadow-xl shadow-black/40 select-none\"><span>&gt; <!-- -->loading_tags</span><span class=\"text-[#8FBF3F] font-bold\">[ ▖ ]</span></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"border-t border-[#212623] bg-[#0A0C0B] py-10 sm:py-12 text-[#8A8F87]\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 md:grid-cols-4\"><div class=\"md:col-span-2 space-y-3\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-mono text-sm font-bold tracking-tight text-white group\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"text-[#8FBF3F] group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-transform duration-200\">&gt;</span><span>crawlers //</span></a><p class=\"text-xs leading-relaxed max-w-md text-[#8A8F87] font-sans\">Discover AI bots and command utilities organized strictly by the job to be done. We index, verify, and link directly to external creators.</p></div><div><h3 class=\"text-xs font-sans font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white mb-3\">Index Sections</h3><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-xs font-mono\"><li><a class=\"hover:text-[#8FBF3F] transition-colors\" href=\"/category/general-reasoning\">/<!-- -->general-reasoning</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-[#8FBF3F] transition-colors\" href=\"/category/developer-tools\">/<!-- -->developer-tools</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-[#8FBF3F] transition-colors\" href=\"/category/search-research\">/<!-- -->search-research</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-[#8FBF3F] transition-colors\" href=\"/category/creative-media\">/<!-- -->creative-media</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-[#8FBF3F] transition-colors\" href=\"/category/ai-extensions\">/<!-- -->ai-extensions</a></li><li class=\"pt-1 flex flex-col gap-1.5 font-sans font-bold text-xs\"><a class=\"text-[#8FBF3F] hover:underline font-mono text-xs\" href=\"/changelog\">/changelog →</a><a class=\"text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors font-normal\" href=\"/\">All Categories →</a></li></ul></div><div><h3 class=\"text-xs font-sans font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white mb-3\">Compliance</h3><p class=\"text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-[#8A8F87]/80 font-sans\">We built Crawlers to catalog AI tools by use case. Our crawler searches Product Hunt and GitHub feeds, checks robots.txt to respect site policies, and paraphrases marketing copy in our own words to avoid copyright issues. We don&#x27;t embed or iframe external tools — we link you straight to the source.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-8 sm:mt-10 border-t border-[#212623]/80 pt-6 sm:pt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs font-sans text-center sm:text-left\"><p class=\"text-[#8A8F87]/70\">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> crawlers_index. All rights reserved.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3 font-sans font-semibold\"><a class=\"hover:text-[#8FBF3F] transition-colors\" href=\"/collections\">Collections</a><span class=\"text-[#212623]\">|</span><a class=\"hover:text-[#8FBF3F] transition-colors\" href=\"/submit\">Submit Entry</a><span class=\"text-[#212623]\">|</span><span class=\"text-[#8A8F87]/60 font-normal\">Link-out Only</span></div></div></div></footer><!--$!--><template data-dgst=\"BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING\"></template><!--/$--><!--$!--><template data-dgst=\"BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING\"></template><!--/$--><!--$!--><template da